{
  "comment": [
    "Hand-built PRE-REDUCED scan ATPG view for LOS (launch-on-shift) tests.",
    "Chain 0 = [ff0 @pos0 (head), ff1 @pos1]; Chain 1 = [ff2 @pos0 (head, alone)].",
    "Under LOS the launch is the last scan shift, so capture PPI of a FF = the",
    "LAUNCH PPI of its chain predecessor; the chain head's capture PPI is a fresh",
    "scan-in bit (free). Observability:",
    "  Y        = __ppi_ff1          (ff1 Q-stem transition reaches a real PO)",
    "  __ppo_ff0 = A XOR __ppi_ff0    (ff0 head Q-stem reaches a pseudo-PO)",
    "  __ppo_ff1 = A XOR __ppi_ff1",
    "  __ppo_ff2 = __ppi_ff2          (single-FF chain head reaches a pseudo-PO)",
    "Real PI: A. The test supplies the chain order via LosCouple/head lists."
  ],
